This is a TypeScript Expo React Native project for petroleum operations management.

Tech Stack:
- Expo SDK 54
- TypeScript
- React Navigation (Bottom Tabs + Native Stack)
- React Native Paper (Material Design)
- Supabase for backend
- Async Storage for local data
- Expo Notifications

Coding Standards:
- Use functional components with hooks
- Follow TypeScript best practices
- Use Material Design components from react-native-paper
- Implement proper error handling
- Use async/await for asynchronous operations
- Follow Expo best practices and guidelines

Project Structure:
- /screens - React Native screens
- /components - Reusable components
- /services - API and data services
- /types - TypeScript type definitions
- /utils - Utility functions